The Big Sur build leaves ANGLE out: the vendor build doesn't make it (patch 17), so the app doesn't embed its libEGL
and libGLESv2, and Settings ▸ General has no ANGLE renderer toggle. Devices draw with OpenGL (CGL), as on
v1.0-2026.10.21. ANGLE is a 9 GB gclient checkout to build, its Metal backend is untried on macOS 11 and Intel HD
graphics, and the renderer is experimental and off by default upstream.

